between this machine and another similar machine that saves the files
correctly... I have some books on C but I can't find what errno 13
is.

I had the original senders re-send the attachments to two different
email addresses and the problem follows the above mentioned machine
only.. Have never experienced this before..

Any suggestions?  TIA..

